{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846", "id": 1297765254, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5NWlOG", "number": 1846, "title": "Command unsupported (511). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:198)", "user": {"login": "linuxguy123", "id": 1920754, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjA3NTQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1920754?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123", "html_url": "https://github.com/linuxguy123", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/linuxguy123/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 7, "created_at": "2022-07-07T16:51:49Z", "updated_at": "2023-09-06T17:54:04Z", "closed_at": "2022-07-08T11:28:12Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "test.cpp is [MAVSDK/takeoff_and_land.cpp at v1.4.3 \u00b7 mavlink/MAVSDK \u00b7 GitHub](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/v1.4.3/examples/takeoff_and_land/takeoff_and_land.cpp)\r\n\r\nThe flight controller is a Pixhawk running Arduplane V3.10.0. Mission Planner 1.3.76 talks to it without issue.\r\n\r\nThe platform is Fedora 36, KDE, X11. Compiler is gcc.\r\n\r\nWhen I run test.cpp (takeoff_and_land/takeoff_and_land.cpp), I get the following output:\r\n\r\n```\r\n./test serial:///dev/serial/by-id/usb-3D_Robotics_PX4_FMU_v2.x_0-if00\r\n[04:13:54|Info ] MAVSDK version: v1.4.3 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:20)\r\nWaiting to discover system\u2026\r\n[04:13:54|Debug] New: System ID: 1 Comp ID: 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:482)\r\n[04:13:54|Debug] Component Autopilot (1) added. (system_impl.cpp:377)\r\n[04:13:54|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (system_impl.cpp:578)\r\nDiscovered autopilot\r\n[04:13:55|Warn ] command unsupported (511). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:198)\r\n[04:13:55|Warn ] command unsupported (511). (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:198)\r\nSetting rate failed: Unsupported\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe code segment in question is:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n // Instantiate the telemetry plugin.\r\nauto telemetry = Telemetry{system};\r\nauto action = Action{system};\r\n\r\n// We want to listen to the altitude of the drone at 1 Hz.\r\nconst auto set_rate_result = telemetry.set_rate_position(1.0);\r\nif (set_rate_result != Telemetry::Result::Success) {\r\n    std::cerr << \"Setting rate failed: \" << set_rate_result << '\\n';\r\n    return 1;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHow do I format a code block in this editor ?", "closed_by": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVauth