", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/anjaliJT/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-01-27T11:20:25Z", "updated_at": "2023-01-27T11:20:43Z", "body": "@JonasVautherin \r\nI'm using MAV_CMD_USER_4 for custom message but it's showing unsupported.\r\nhow to use this command without error.\r\ni'm sending it like : \r\n\r\nvehicle.send_mavlink(vehicle.message_factory.command_long_encode(\r\n            0, 0,  # target system, target component\r\n            mavutil.mavlink.MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME,  # command\r\n            0,  # confirmation\r\n            0,  # param 1: 1 to use current position, 0 to use the entered values.\r\n            0, 0, 0,  # params 2-4\r\n            0.0, 0.0, 0.0))\r\n\r\n@vehicle.on_message('*')\r\ndef message(n,m,m2):\r\n    print(m2)", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1406362695/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1406512040", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846#issuecomment-1406512040", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846", "id": 1406512040, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5T1auo", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-01-27T13:29:08Z", "updated_at": "2023-01-27T13:29:08Z", "body": "Feels like this is unrelated to the question (which was for 511). Can you please open a new issue with a meaningful title? :see_no_evil: ", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1406512040/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1708841676", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846#issuecomment-1708841676", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846", "id": 1708841676, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5l2trM", "user": {"login": "cryptik", "id": 1165640, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU2NDA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1165640?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik", "html_url": "https://github.com/cryptik", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-09-06T17:54:04Z", "updated_at": "2023-09-06T17:54:04Z", "body": "This is a closed issue, but I am going to add some latest behavior in case this may need to be reopened.  I am using mavsdk_server from version MAVSDK_Python that I built from source using git tag 1.4.8 on Debian ARM64.  The mavsdk_server binary runs just fine and reports v1.4.16 on startup.\r\n\r\nThe problem I have is that if I make the following call:\r\n`await self._drone.core.set_mavlink_timeout(1.0)`\r\n\r\nAny subsequent calls to \r\n```\r\nawait self._drone.telemetry.set_rate_gps_info(3.0)\r\nawait self._drone.telemetry.set_rate_position_velocity_ned(10.0)\r\nawait self._drone.telemetry.set_rate_home(5.0)\r\nawait self._drone.telemetry.set_rate_battery(1.0)\r\n```\r\nwill result in the error \r\n```\r\n[05:27:56|Warn ] Received ack for not-existing command: 511! Ignoring... (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:258)\r\n```\r\nIf I remove the call to `set_mavlink_timeout` completely, the calls to `set_rate_` for the other message streams works just fine.\r\n\r\nI am running the latest Ardu firmware on CubePilot.  I know that `mavsdk_server` primarily supports PX4, so I was not sure if this behavior is by design.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1708841676/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1178020603", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1846#iss