y.set_rate_home(5.0)\r\nawait self._drone.telemetry.set_rate_battery(1.0)\r\n```\r\nwill result in the error \r\n```\r\n[05:27:56|Warn ] Received ack for not-existing command: 511! Ignoring... (mavlink_command_sender.cpp:258)\r\n```\r\nIf I remove the call to `set_mavlink_timeout` completely, the calls to `set_rate_` for the other message streams works just fine.\r\n\r\nI am running the latest Ardu firmware on CubePilot.  I know that `mavsdk_server` primarily supports PX4, so I was not sure if this behavior is by design.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1708841676/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "cryptik", "id": 1165640, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU2NDA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1165640?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik", "html_url": "https://github.com/cryptik", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cryptik/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}], "fetched_at": "2026-08-28T20:38:51Z"}